#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_field_scale
#! from    10
#! frames  175
#! poster  80
# drag the legend upwards (the log range moves to smaller values, the field brightens), zoom the range with the
# wheel over the legend, then press "reset range"
0   move 860 300
5   move 735 330 15
25  down
27  move 735 230 45
75  up
85  wheel 0 1
92  wheel 0 1
99  wheel 0 1
115 move 60 492 20
140 down
142 up
160 move 860 300 10
